Z||000012||olympic||11-14-1999||07:14 PM||||Fiero's are pretty rare here in Canada. I don't think they really cought on. About 9 years ago my older brother had a black 88 formula with t-tops. It was the coolest car around(to me anyway!!) I've been looking for an 88 for a project car but less than 700(including coupes, formulas and GT's)  were sold in Canada!!!  I'll orobably have to bring one up from the States eventually.||||reg||1
Z||000013||fiero56||11-14-1999||09:12 PM||||According to my Fiero Spotters Guide, there was a grand total of 730 1988 Fieros exported to Canada.  The numbers are:<BR>'88 coupe/Formula-307<BR>'88 GT-423<BR>The option RPO code for Canada exports is "Z49".||||reg||14
