Z||000023||fiero56||11-16-1999||08:46 AM||||Hey Scott,<BR>Sounds like you drove my usual haunts. I did a quick run to the post office on Paragon, but that was early morning(had to drop off another Studen Loan check), I hate doing that. <BR>I notice quite a few people checking out my little Fiero. Got a thumbs up from a guy in his boxster on Lyons yesterday.  <BR>I also saw the guy in the maroon '87(?) GT that drives past my house every day at the same time, 4:40.  He gave me the usuall wave as I was pulling out of the drive.  For the week I also saw a gold '87 coupe on 725, right in downtown Centerville.<p>[This message has been edited by fiero56 (edited 11-16-1999).]||||reg||10
